6
00:00:06,226 --> 00:00:07,455
How blue they look depends

7
00:00:07,455 --> 00:00:08,490
on how deep and how

8
00:00:08,490 --> 00:00:09,469
wide the vein is.

9
00:00:09,489 --> 00:00:11,109
Octopuses really do have blue

10
00:00:11,109 --> 00:00:12,789
blood, built around copper.

11
00:00:12,809 --> 00:00:13,373
But you?

12
00:00:13,393 --> 00:00:14,917
Yours is red every time.

13
00:00:14,937 --> 00:00:15,815
So no matter what you

